<decision #track.lifecycle_directories.single_root {
  status = "accepted"
  blocks = []
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>Where should track lifecycle state live?</?>
  <answer ?>Under codument/tracks as pending, active, and archived directories.</?>
  <evidence ?>Missions already use this model, and the user explicitly requested the same layout for tracks.</?>
  <confidence ?>0.99</?>
  <reversibility ?>moderate</?>
)>

<decision #track.lifecycle_directories.upgrade_safety {
  status = "accepted"
  blocks = []
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>How should upgrade-workspace handle a destination conflict?</?>
  <answer ?>Keep the legacy source in place, report the conflict, and rely on the pre-migration backup rather than overwriting data.</?>
  <evidence ?>A track directory is user-owned project history and cannot be silently replaced.</?>
  <confidence ?>0.98</?>
  <reversibility ?>low</?>
)>

<decision #track.topological_decision_questions.frontier_batches {
  status = "accepted"
  blocks = []
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>How should planning ask a decision forest with multiple roots?</?>
  <answer ?>Ask every independently answerable root or unlocked child in one bounded topological batch, then recompute after the response.</?>
  <evidence ?>The requested protocol must avoid serialising unrelated decision directions while retaining dependency order.</?>
  <confidence ?>0.99</?>
  <reversibility ?>moderate</?>
)>

<decision #track.enable_modeling_and_atomic_archive.default_enablement {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = 0.99
  reversibility = "easy"
}
(
  <question ?>Modeling 的默认启用语义是什么？</?>
  <recommendation ?>fresh init 模板与缺省 loader 都默认 enabled，显式 false 始终保留。</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>用户同意 modeling 默认值改为 true，并明确普通 track 不强制生成 delta。</?>
    <decision-text ?>缺失配置时 modeling 默认启用；模板输出 enabled=true；已有显式 enabled=false 不被 upgrade 覆盖。</?>
    <rationale ?>让结构知识能力开箱即用，同时尊重项目的明确关闭选择。</?>
    <evidence ?>Mission decision `mission.evolve_codument_action_system.modeling`。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #track.enable_modeling_and_atomic_archive.delta_trigger {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = 0.99
  reversibility = "easy"
}
(
  <question ?>默认启用后何时必须生成 modeling delta？</?>
  <recommendation ?>仅结构知识变化时生成；无结构变化时不制造空 delta 或 registry。</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>用户同意按对象、状态机、policy、模块边界、事实源、组件 IO 等结构变化触发。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Modeling enablement 与 delta obligation 分离；启用不等于每 track 必有 delta。</?>
    <rationale ?>避免默认启用演化为文档噪声和无意义的空 registry。</?>
    <evidence ?>Mission proposal 与 accepted modeling decision。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #track.enable_modeling_and_atomic_archive.atomic_boundary {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = 0.99
  reversibility = "moderate"
}
(
  <question ?>跨 registry archive 的失败边界如何定义？</?>
  <recommendation ?>全部 prepare/validate/conflict detect 成功后才 commit；commit 失败 rollback；成功后才移动 track。</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>用户明确要求 behavior/modeling/engineering 共享原子边界，失败不写任何内容且不移动 track。</?>
    <decision-text ?>三个 registry 与 track move 构成单一可观察事务；任一失败恢复 archive 前实际态。</?>
    <rationale ?>防止长期行为、结构和工程知识真源出现彼此不一致的半归档状态。</?>
    <evidence ?>Mission design 的 Registry 原子归档模型与用户确认。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #track.conditional_decision_activation.graph_nodes {
  status = "accepted"
  blocks = []
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>How should a combination of decisions create a new planning question?</?>
  <answer ?>Materialize a same-level conditional decision with explicit prerequisites, activation predicate, and provenance.</?>
  <evidence ?>A static nested tree cannot represent a question that depends on choices from multiple independent roots.</?>
  <confidence ?>0.99</?>
  <reversibility ?>moderate</?>
)>

